        "original_id": "a7644ae5-9b7d-5f8b-9c4d-2ad4e100e377",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Michael Landon, Charles Ingalls\n- Roles: Little Joe Cartwright, Charles Ingalls, Jonathan Smith, Pa\n- TV series: Bonanza, Little House on the Prairie, Highway to Heaven\n\nFacts:\n- Michael Landon was born Eugene Maurice Orowitz on October 31, 1936, and he was an American actor, writer, director, and producer.\n- Michael Landon played Little Joe Cartwright in the television series \"Bonanza\" from 1959 to 1973.\n- Michael Landon played Charles Ingalls in the television series \"Little House on the Prairie\" from 1974 to 1983.\n- Michael Landon played Jonathan Smith in the television series \"Highway to Heaven\" from 1984 to 1989.\n- Charles Ingalls is depicted as the character \"Pa\" in the books and the television series.\n- Michael Landon died on July 1, 1991.",
